- Claude subagents use the Agent or Workflow model parameter. Cross-provider lanes (Sol, Grok, Kimi) go through the `pickforge-lanes` MCP tools, which reject Anthropic selectors by design. The `model-orchestration` skill owns dispatch mechanics.
